PROCEDURE cb_get-cash-desk-list :
DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-callback-handle AS HANDLE NO-UNDO.
DEFINE BUFFER buf_tt-cash-desk FOR tt-cash-desk.
FOR EACH buf_tt-cash-desk:
